<title>UK: UK's OFT seeks comment on BP, Go-Ahead buys.</title>
<headline>UK's OFT seeks comment on BP, Go-Ahead buys.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading has invited comment on two proposed takeovers -- that of Charrington Fuels Ltd by BP Oil UK Ltd and the planned acquisition of Brighton Transport by The Go-Ahead Group.</p>
<p>Comments on either takeover should be submitted by May 15, the Office of Fair Trading said in a statement.</p>
<p>The OFT will then consider whether to advise that either of the takeovers should be referred to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission (MMC).</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
